# Alcor XPR links in docs

When linking to Alcor **UI** (swap, analytics, farms, pools, tokens) in any markdown or generated doc page, **always** use the new v2 XPR paths on `alcor.exchange`:

| Purpose | URL |
| --- | --- |
| Swap (default trade / buy) | `https://alcor.exchange/v/xpr/swap` |
| Swap with pair | `https://alcor.exchange/v/xpr/swap?input=…&output=…` |
| Analytics home | `https://alcor.exchange/v/xpr/analytics` |
| Farms | `https://alcor.exchange/v/xpr/analytics?tab=farms` |
| Token page | `https://alcor.exchange/v/xpr/analytics/tokens/EASY-mon3y` |
| Pool page | `https://alcor.exchange/v/xpr/analytics/pools/{id}` |

## Do not use for user-facing UI links

- `https://proton.alcor.exchange` (legacy UI)
- `https://proton.alcor.exchange/swap…`
- `https://proton.alcor.exchange/analytics…`

## API (scripts / data refresh only)

Keep the Proton API host for fetches: `https://proton.alcor.exchange/api/v2/…`  
API docs may stay at `https://api.alcor.exchange/`. Do not point readers to the old UI when the intent is “go trade / see farms / open a pool.”
